{"ref":"BDB, חֹסָה","hw":"חֹסָה","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">חֹסָה</span></big> <strong>1.</strong>  <strong> n.pr.m. (</strong>refuge<strong>)</strong>—name of one of the Levitical doorkeepers of the temple <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 16:38\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.16.38\">1 Ch 16:38</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 26:10\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.26.10\">26:10</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 26:11\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.26.11\">11</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 26:16\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.26.16\">16</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  <strong> n.pr.loc.</strong> place in the tribe of Asher <a data-ref=\"Joshua 19:29\" href=\"/Joshua.19.29\">Jos 19:29</a>; site unknown; 𝔊 Ιασιφ, A Σουσα, 𝔊L Ωσα.","next":"BDB, חָסוּת","prev":"BDB, חָסָה"}